.TH "createStp" "1" "" "SequoiaDB User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
createStp \- create STP service
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\f[B]oma.createStp( [config] )\f[]
.SH CATEGORY
.PP
Oma
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
This function is used to create STP service(Sequence Time Protocol service) in
target host of sdbcm.
.SH PARAMETERS
.PP
config ( \f[I]object, Optional\f[] )
.PP
STP configuration information.
.IP \[bu] 2
port (number): STP listening port.
The default value is 9622.
.IP \[bu] 2
serverlist (string): STP server list.
The default value is null, which means the host name of this machine.
.IP \[bu] 2
role (string): STP role.
The default value is "server".
.IP \[bu] 2
syncinterval (number): STP synchronize interval in seconds.
The default value is 60.
.IP \[bu] 2
maxtimeerror (number): STP max time error in microseconds, range from 1000 to
10000000.
The default value is 50000.
.IP \[bu] 2
diaglevel (number): STP dialog level.
The default value is 3.
.SH RETURN VALUE
.PP
When the function executes successfully, it will return an object of STP.
.PP
When the function fails, an exception will be thrown and an error message will
be printed.
