For more details, refer to Troubleshooting.
.SH VERSION
.PP
v5.0 and above
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Create and start a STP process.
.IP
.nf
\f[C]
> var oma = new Oma("localhost",11790)
> oma.createStp()
> oma.startStp()
\f[]
.fi
